"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4486060","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2996900-1844115010494494","game_id":"steam-2996900","kind":"update","title":"Delicious Demo Update!","summary":"Hello! Ed here with another update on Dungeons & Desserts. We've been very busy these past few months, and I'm so happy to finally share this one with you. Heads up: saves have moved to support Steam Cloud, so, if you played the demo, this update starts you on a fresh save. There's a lot of new stuff, so it's a great excuse to start again! Combat that flows The feedback we heard most was that combat felt a bit slow, so that's where we focused first. The hero and every enemy now move and attack f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T11:25:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494494","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2996900-1834602721189364","game_id":"steam-2996900","kind":"announcement","title":"Dungeons & Desserts is Coming in Q4 2026!","summary":"Hey everyone!We've got news we've been waiting a long time to share: Dungeons & Desserts has a release window: Q4 2026!We announced it as part of the LAGS showcase, alongside a brand-new trailer fresh out of the oven, which you can check out in the GameTrailers YouTube Channel:What this meansAfter a couple of years of slow baking, the game is finally taking its final shape. We're close enough to confidently give the game a rough release window and we can't wait to share the journey to launch wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T03:30:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721189364","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2996900-1833968530889692","game_id":"steam-2996900","kind":"announcement","title":"🍰 Dungeons & Desserts has been selected for the Latin American Games Showcase!","summary":"Super happy to announce that Dungeons & Desserts has been selected for the Latin American Games Showcase: Summer Game Fest Edition 2026!We have a brand new trailer + an exciting announcement during the showcase, don't miss it! 🍰Showcase will be streamed June 4th, 2PM PT! Don't miss it, lots of cool games being showcased.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T23:38:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889692","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2996900-1832700592797948","game_id":"steam-2996900","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo just got a lot more dangerous, and a lot more... delicious.","summary":"Here's what's new on both sides of the game!In the DungeonTrap visuals overhaul the old placeholders are out. Everything hits harder, looks meaner.New puzzle room defeat three enemies in a specific order to crack open a bonus treasure chest.Taffy's weapon samples she's set up shop in the weapon rooms and will occasionally let you take one of her weapons or abilities for a spin. Try before you buy!New abilities & weapon upgrades:Frying Pan: new 3rd attack, an aimable AOE slamCandy Shards: slick n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-18T11:02:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592797948","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2996900-1821922921814856","game_id":"steam-2996900","kind":"announcement","title":"Claim your Free Beta Access!","summary":"Hey everyone!We're thrilled to announce that Dungeons & Desserts is having a free beta week, starting January 30th and ending February 8th!What is the Free Beta Week?For one week, you'll be able to play the beta version of Dungeons & Desserts completely free. No strings attached, just sign up, get your Steam key, and dive in.Experience the full loop of dungeon crawling through candy-themed realms, gathering rare ingredients, and returning to your cozy bakery to craft mouthwatering desserts for h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-16T03:55:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921814856","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2996900-1819386365097428","game_id":"steam-2996900","kind":"announcement","title":"Candy Crawler is now Dungeons & Desserts! New Name, Same Sweet Adventure","summary":"Hey everyone!We've got some exciting news to share. Candy Crawler is now Dungeons & Desserts!Why the change?As development progressed, we realized the original name wasn't quite capturing what makes this game special. Dungeons & Desserts is a unique blend of roguelite dungeon crawling and cozy pastry shop management, and we wanted a name that immediately tells you that.What's new?Along with the new name, we've also updated our key art to better showcase the dual-genre gameplay. The portal teases","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-20T06:09:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365097428","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2996900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"new